&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;o&quot; data-font=&quot;Courier New&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1440,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[9675],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;o&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;7&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You are familiar with monitoring and alerting practices for production systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;o&quot; data-font=&quot;Courier New&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1440,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[9675],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;o&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;7&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You have experience defining and working with SLAs/SLOs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;An&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;unlimited&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;contract with 30 vacation days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Flexible, hybrid work:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;You can work from home or come into the office on the schedule that works best for you. Feel like traveling and working from another location? No problem. Tune into meetings and work from abroad for up to 40 days per year. In addition, flex hours allow you to prioritize important moments in your day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Attractive perks and benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We offer a company pension scheme, language courses (English/German), and employee discounts with selected sustainable brands. Furthermore, our external partners in mental health support you in strengthening your mental health through anonymous private/group sessions.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Virtual Shares Program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: Participate in the success of GROPYUS through our Virtual Share Program.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: You can truly make your mark with your work and contributions – on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;all our organizational levels. Find your solutions, drive and test them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The chance to be part of something big&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: Our mission is to rethink an entire industry. Join us in reinventing construction and fostering sustainable, affordable living.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A diverse and enriching work environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: Become a valued member of a wonderfully diverse team of individuals from over 50 countries. At GROPYUS we value inclusion above all, ensuring that everyone feels they belong – no matter their background. In this way, our differences become strengths that help us grow as a team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Join us on our mission to design buildings as continuously evolving products to create the most exciting and affordable experience for all. We build for people and conserve the resources of our planet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We can&#39;t wait to get to know you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;For more information, visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gropyus.com/&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;, and if you have any questions, please reach out to us via&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;email&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GROPYUS is a technology-based construction company focused on building multi-story residential buildings. Thanks to its prefabricated building system with various design options, industrial offsite construction, and fully digitalized processes, the company manufactures aspirational, sustainable, and affordable homes using timber construction methods. GROPYUS is using scalable construction and manufacturing solutions to tap into a future market, boost Europe&#39;s strength in innovation, while also playing a substantial role in improving sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;85&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;83&quot;&gt;Über die Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;87&quot; data-end=&quot;271&quot;&gt;Das &lt;strong data-start=&quot;91&quot; data-end=&quot;116&quot;&gt;Building Systems Team&lt;/strong&gt; entwickelt das &lt;strong data-start=&quot;132&quot; data-end=&quot;153&quot;&gt;GROPYUS-Bausystem&lt;/strong&gt; und ermöglicht die Projektumsetzung, indem es physische und digitale Produkte sowie Prozesse miteinander verbindet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;273&quot; data-end=&quot;752&quot;&gt;Das &lt;strong data-start=&quot;277&quot; data-end=&quot;314&quot;&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Interior Design Team&lt;/strong&gt; innerhalb des BST besteht aus Architekt:innen, Interior Designer:innen sowie Expert:innen für BIM und parametrisches Design. Als Teil dieses Teams bist du in die &lt;strong data-start=&quot;477&quot; data-end=&quot;499&quot;&gt;Produktentwicklung&lt;/strong&gt;, die &lt;strong data-start=&quot;505&quot; data-end=&quot;528&quot;&gt;Wertschöpfungskette&lt;/strong&gt; und die &lt;strong data-start=&quot;537&quot; data-end=&quot;578&quot;&gt;Entwicklungsprozesse von Bauprojekten&lt;/strong&gt; eingebunden - in enger Zusammenarbeit mit den anderen Teams im BST (Production Data, Integrated Engineering und Building Technologies) sowie mit weiteren Abteilungen bei Gropyus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;273&quot; data-end=&quot;752&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;759&quot; data-end=&quot;782&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;759&quot; data-end=&quot;780&quot;&gt;Über die Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;786&quot; data-end=&quot;870&quot;&gt;Projektentwicklung in der &lt;strong&gt;Leistungsphase LP5&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;873&quot; data-end=&quot;976&quot;&gt;Umsetzung modernster architektonischer und technischer Lösungen in unserem &lt;strong data-start=&quot;948&quot; data-end=&quot;974&quot;&gt;Holzwohnungsbauprodukt&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;979&quot; data-end=&quot;1096&quot;&gt;Kontinuierliche und kontrollierte Weiterentwicklung des Produkts im Rahmen des &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1058&quot; data-end=&quot;1094&quot;&gt;Serien- und Änderungsmanagements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1099&quot; data-end=&quot;1209&quot;&gt;Koordination mit Fachdisziplinen wie &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1136&quot; data-end=&quot;1207&quot;&gt;Engineering, TGA, Bauphysik, Akustik, Brandschutz und Energiedesign&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1212&quot; data-end=&quot;1349&quot;&gt;Mitwirkung an der Verbesserung unserer &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1251&quot; data-end=&quot;1284&quot;&gt;digitalen Wertschöpfungskette&lt;/strong&gt; in enger Zusammenarbeit mit den Produkt- und Technologie-Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1352&quot; data-end=&quot;1446&quot;&gt;Gestaltung unter Berücksichtigung von &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1390&quot; data-end=&quot;1444&quot;&gt;Nutzerzentrierung, DfMA, Nachhaltigkeit und Kosten&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1453&quot; data-end=&quot;1468&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1453&quot; data-end=&quot;1466&quot;&gt;Über dich&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Document Subtitle&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;a6931eb7-c724-5fbf-b762-26f860ca887f|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[469777841,&amp;quot;Pangea SemiBold&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Pangea SemiBold&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Pangea SemiBold,Calibri&amp;quot;,335551500,&amp;quot;16431800&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;48&amp;quot;,335559740,&amp;quot;192&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,335559739,&amp;quot;160&amp;quot;,335559738,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;Document Subtitle&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134234082,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;DocumentSubtitle&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134224900,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,335551547,&amp;quot;1033&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Normal&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;Minimale Voraussetzungen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:192}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1472&quot; data-end=&quot;1535&quot;&gt;Projekterfahrung in der &lt;strong&gt;technischen Detailentwicklung&lt;/strong&gt;/&lt;strong&gt;LP5&lt;/strong&gt; in Deutschland (mind. 3 Jahre) mit Schwerpunkt technische Detailentwicklung (insb. Gebäudehülle und Rohbau)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1472&quot; data-end=&quot;1535&quot;&gt;Kenntnisse der relevanten&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1629&quot; data-end=&quot;1666&quot;&gt;deutschen Bauvorschriften- und Normen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung im &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1684&quot; data-end=&quot;1695&quot;&gt;Holzbau&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1538&quot; data-end=&quot;1600&quot;&gt;Erfahrung im Umgang mit den &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1551&quot; data-end=&quot;1598&quot;&gt;Gebäudeklassen 4 und/oder 5&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1800&quot; data-end=&quot;1845&quot;&gt;Fließende Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Bevorzugte Voraussetzungen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung im &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1551&quot; data-end=&quot;1598&quot;&gt;Wohnungsbau &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1714&quot; data-end=&quot;1723&quot;&gt;Revit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1742&quot; data-end=&quot;1753&quot;&gt;AutoCAD&lt;/strong&gt;; und Kenntnisse in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1769&quot; data-end=&quot;1778&quot;&gt;Rhino&lt;/strong&gt; sind von Vorteil&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was wir bieten:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ein &lt;strong&gt;unbefristeter Vertrag &lt;/strong&gt;mit 30 Urlaubstagen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MailCompose&quot;&gt;Flexible Arbeitsweise&lt;/strong&gt;: Wir legen großen Wert auf regelmäßige persönliche Zusammenarbeit im Büro, und bieten auch die Möglichkeit zum Arbeiten im Homeoffice sowie die Option, bis zu 40 Tage im Jahr aus dem Ausland zu arbeiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attraktive Zusatzleistungen&lt;/strong&gt;: Wir bieten eine betriebliche Altersvorsorge, Sprachkurse (Englisch/Deutsch) und Mitarbeiterrabatte bei ausgewählten nachhaltigen Marken. Darüber hinaus unterstützen Dich unsere externen Partner im Bereich mentale Gesundheit, um Deine psychische Gesundheit durch anonyme Einzel- oder Gruppensitzungen zu stärken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Virtuelles Aktienprogramm&lt;/strong&gt;: Profitiere von GROPYUS Erfolg durch unser Virtuelles Aktienprogramm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Eigenverantwortung&lt;/strong&gt;: Du kannst wirklich etwas bewirken – auf allen Ebenen unserer Organisation. Finde Lösungen, treibe sie voran, teste und implementiere sie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Die Chance, Teil von etwas Großem zu sein&lt;/strong&gt;: Unsere Mission ist es, eine ganze Branche neu zu denken. Hilf uns dabei, das Bauwesen neu zu erfinden und nachhaltiges, erschwingliches Wohnen zu fördern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ein vielfältiges und bereicherndes Arbeitsumfeld&lt;/strong&gt;: Werde ein geschätztes Mitglied eines wunderbar vielfältigen Teams von Menschen aus über 50 Ländern. Bei GROPYUS legen wir großen Wert auf Inklusion und sorgen dafür, dass sich jeder – unabhängig von seinem Hintergrund – als Teil der Gemeinschaft fühlt. So werden unsere Unterschiede zu Stärken, die uns als Team weiterbringen.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Join us on our mission to design buildings as continuously evolving products to create the most exciting and affordable experience for all. We build for people and conserve the resources of our planet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We can&#39;t wait to get to know you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;For more information, visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gropyus.com/&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;, and if you have any questions, please reach out to us via&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;email&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GROPYUS is a technology-based construction company focused on building multi-story residential buildings. Thanks to its prefabricated building system with various design options, industrial offsite construction, and fully digitalized processes, the company manufactures aspirational, sustainable, and affordable homes using timber construction methods. GROPYUS is using scalable construction and manufacturing solutions to tap into a future market, boost Europe&#39;s strength in innovation, while also playing a substantial role in improving sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Building Systems Team designs the GROPYUS building system and enables project realization by connecting physical and digital products and processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Architecture Interior Design Team within BST comprises architects, interior designers, BIM and parametric design experts. As part of the team, you will be involved in Product Development, Value Chain and Construction Project Development Processes in close collaboration with the other teams in BST (Drafting, Integrated Engineering and Building Technologies), as well as other Departments across Gropyus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project development in stage LP5&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementation of state-of-the-art architectural and technical solutions in our timber residential Building Product&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constant and controlled evolution of the Product within the Series- and Change Management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordination with design disciplines like Engineering, MEP, Building Physics, Acoustics, Fire Protection, and Energy Design&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the improvement of our Digital Value Chain in close collaboration with the Product and Technology Teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design for user centricity, DfMA, sustainability, and cost&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must have&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project experience in technical detail development of the project stage LP5 in Germany (min. 3 years), focusing on technical detailed design, particularly the building envelope and structural works&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in relevant German building regulations and codes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in timber construction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with building class 4/5&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent German and English skills&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nice to have&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with residential buildings&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Revit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in AutoCAD and in Rhino&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;6&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;unlimited&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;contract &lt;/strong&gt;with 30 vacation days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MailCompose&quot;&gt;Flexible work:&lt;/strong&gt; We value regular in‑person collaboration in the office, while also offering working from home and the opportunity to work up to 40 days a year from abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
